# Lukeatron: only System/ and .claude/ are version-controlled.
# Personal data (Memory/, Inbox/, Outbox/, Archive/) and local/secret state
# (Sandbox/, Credentials/, local settings, temp files) never go to GitHub.

/*
!/System/
!/.claude/
!/.gitignore

# Rhetoric keeps its database and Python caches tracked (Luke, 2026-10-06; the caches are re-allowed at the foot of
# this file, after the rules that ignore them). Its dated backups in Archive/ are NOT: they were removed from GitHub
# on 2026-10-06, so all of Archive/ stays local like the rest of the personal data above.

# Within System/: exclude scratch, and the entire Credentials/ directory
# (all credential material stays local-only; nothing under it is ever pushed)
/System/Sandbox/**
/System/Credentials/

# Within .claude/: exclude local-only settings and temp files
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/*.tmp

# Junk / build artifacts, wherever they appear under the tracked trees
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets: an API key file is local-only wherever it sits under the tracked trees
.env

# Runtime logs (server output etc.) — never version-controlled
*.log

# Home: the day's verse cache and per-app launch logs
/System/Apps/Home/cache/

# App construction files stay local (Luke, 2026-10-06; only an app's wishlist.md is part of the finished app):
# build folders, specs, mockups and spikes, wherever they sit. A finished app deletes its _build/.
_build/
_Builds/
_Mockups/
_Spikes/
_scratch_build/
Specs/

# Storytelling: its build tooling (share/) and output (dist/) are committed. Its construction work stays local:
# everything in reference/work/ except added-elements.json, and everything in verify/ except verify-checks.js (its
# tests read those two). The original poster is archived in Archive/ and stays local until the poster's licence
# (PRD open question OQ-X1) is settled — this repo is public.
/System/Apps/Storytelling/reference/work/*
!/System/Apps/Storytelling/reference/work/added-elements.json
/System/Apps/Storytelling/verify/*
!/System/Apps/Storytelling/verify/verify-checks.js
/System/Apps/Storytelling/reference/periodic-table-of-storytelling.png

# Rhetoric's Python caches: re-allowed here because a later rule beats an earlier one (see the Rhetoric note above)
!/System/Apps/Rhetoric/**/__pycache__/
!/System/Apps/Rhetoric/**/*.pyc

# memory-search indexes are machine-local caches (default ~/Library/Caches/Lukeatron/); never commit one
*.sqlite
